cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "pLIN: plasmid Lineage Identification Number"
message: >-
  If you use this software, you MUST cite it using the
  metadata from this file. Citation is a mandatory
  requirement of the license (GPL-3.0 with citation clause).
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Basil Britto
    family-names: Xavier
repository-code: "https://github.com/xavierbasilbritto-hub/pLIN-plasmid-classification"
url: "https://github.com/xavierbasilbritto-hub/pLIN-plasmid-classification"
abstract: >-
  pLIN (plasmid Lineage Identification Number) assigns bacterial
  plasmids permanent, multi-level codes for antimicrobial resistance
  surveillance, from backbone families to near-identical outbreak
  clones, together with replicon, mobility and resistance-gene
  annotation in a desktop and web application.
keywords:
  - plasmid classification
  - plasmid nomenclature
  - antimicrobial resistance
  - AMR surveillance
  - outbreak detection
  - One Health
  - bacterial genomics
  - bioinformatics
